calculate: third-party notices
==============================

calculate is built from the third-party components listed below. Their licence texts are in the
LICENSES directory and are shown in the program (Settings, Third-party licences). The machine-readable
list of every third-party file, its origin and its licence is licensing/manifest.json; an automated
test fails the build if anything listed there is missing.


